 "intro_zh": "西樵山是广东四大名山之一，是中国国家森林公园、中国国家地质公园、国家重点风景名胜区。西樵山自然风光旖旎，山上七十二峰峰峰皆奇，四十二洞洞洞皆幽，更有湖、瀑、泉、涧、岩、壁、潭、台点缀其间。",
 "intro_en": "Mount Xiqiao is a 40- to 50-million-year-old extinct volcano situated in the south west of the Nanhai District, Foshan, Guangdong, People's Republic of China 68 km (42 mi) from Guangzhou. The mountain is an important scenic area and designated as a national forest park and national geological park. Covering an area of 14 square kilometres (5.4 sq mi), the area features a total of 72 peaks with the highest, Dacheng Peak (大秤峰), rising to 346 m (1,135 ft).",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
